02EFF,&H00000000,&H78000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,0,0,1,3.8,3.8,2,180,180,27,1Style: Karaoke,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,8,23,23,23,1Style: Translation,Duality,68,&H00292CC7,&H000019FF,&H00FFFFFF,&H00000000,0,0,0,0,100,100,4,0,1,6.8,0,2,23,23,34,1[Events]Format: Layer, Start, End, Style, Name, MarginL, MarginR, MarginV, Effect, TextDialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:09.99,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 0,0:01:49.92,0:01:59.92,Warning,,0,0,0,,Your media player does not support the subtitle format used in this episode. Subtitles will likely not function properly. Please use one of the recommended video players, preferably mpv: https://mpv.ioDialogue: 50,0:01:55.22,0:01:56.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!Dialogue: 50,0:01:56.72,0:01:59.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're okay?Dialogue: 50,0:02:00.81,0:02:02.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm fine! I'm feeling great!Dialogue: 50,0:02:02.64,0:02:07.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, let's go say bye to  doctor granny and acorn pops, too.Dialogue: 50,0:02:07.77,0:02:09.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.Dialogue: 50,0:02:09.14,0:02:11.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Give him and Doctorine some privacy.Dialogue: 50,0:02:03.23,0:02:06.44,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Done! In commemoration of our arrival,Dialogue: 50,0:02:06.44,0:02:08.65,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,I present Snow Queen V!Dialogue: 50,0:02:08.65,0:02:11.36,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! How dare you kick Snow Queen V!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.36,0:02:12.95,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Mind your manners!Dialogue: 50,0:02:11.74,0:02:14.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's lived alone with her for six years.Dialogue: 50,0:02:14.57,0:02:17.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sure it'll be a tearful farewell.Dialogue: 50,0:02:17.95,0:02:22.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine may act tough, but she's actually a big softie.Dialogue: 50,0:02:23.54,0:02:24.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Really?Dialogue: 50,0:02:24.83,0:02:28.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, we're really leaving without a word, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:02:28.34,0:02:29.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right.Dialogue: 50,0:02:29.59,0:02:34.05,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Once Chopper's back, we'll descend the mountain and set sail for Arabasta pronto!Dialogue: 50,0:02:34.05,0:02:36.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Does that sound good to you, Vivi?Dialogue: 50,0:02:36.51,0:02:39.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, if a doctor comes with us–Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.26,0:02:39.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A doctor?Dialogue: 50,0:02:39.97,0:02:43.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay then, I'll get the ropeway ready.Dialogue: 50,0:02:43.56,0:02:45.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Luffy! Give me a hand.Dialogue: 50,0:02:45.44,0:02:47.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Whoa, there's a ropeway?!Dialogue: 50,0:02:47.65,0:02:50.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's awesome!Dialogue: 50,0:03:00.37,0:03:01.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:03:01.49,0:03:04.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It seems there are some patients missing.Dialogue: 50,0:03:04.50,0:03:05.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They escaped...Dialogue: 50,0:03:06.46,0:03:09.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,disobeying your orders...Dialogue: 50,0:03:09.71,0:03:12.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see... What troublesome brats.Dialogue: 50,0:03:22.31,0:03:23.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine!Dialogue: 50,0:03:25.35,0:03:26.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine!Dialogue: 50,0:03:28.69,0:03:30.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I need to talk to you!Dialogue: 50,0:03:31.27,0:03:33.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper, where have you been?Dialogue: 50,0:03:33.90,0:03:37.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Go downstairs and help them set up the cannons.Dialogue: 50,0:03:37.16,0:03:40.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, Doctorine! I'm gonna be a pirate.Dialogue: 50,0:03:40.41,0:03:41.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going with them!Dialogue: 50,0:03:42.37,0:03:43.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:43.66,0:03:45.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going out to sea!Dialogue: 50,0:03:45.25,0:03:49.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be their ship's doctor and travel around the world!Dialogue: 50,0:03:49.42,0:03:51.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd!Dialogue: 50,0:03:52.00,0:03:56.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen here. You're my one and only assistant!Dialogue: 50,0:03:56.09,0:03:59.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who do you think taught you medicine?!Dialogue: 50,0:03:59.01,0:04:02.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you really that ungrateful?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:02.47,0:04:04.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Th-That's not it...!Dialogue: 50,0:04:04.77,0:04:06.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I really appreciate you, Doctorine,Dialogue: 50,0:04:07.31,0:04:11.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and I will always love this country where I met you and Doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:04:12.44,0:04:14.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Then stay here.Dialogue: 50,0:04:14.44,0:04:19.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll never get another chance to live in a lavish castle like this.Dialogue: 50,0:04:19.66,0:04:21.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are deadbeats.Dialogue: 50,0:04:21.78,0:04:24.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You'll wind up dead in no time.Dialogue: 50,0:04:24.58,0:04:26.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm fine with that!Dialogue: 50,0:04:27.33,0:04:29.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't get cocky!Dialogue: 50,0:04:29.29,0:04:32.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who's ever heard of a reindeer going out to sea?!Dialogue: 50,0:04:32.92,0:04:34.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right! I am a reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:04:34.59,0:04:35.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 50,0:04:35.38,0:04:36.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm also a man!Dialogue: 50,0:04:42.80,0:04:44.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure talk big...Dialogue: 50,0:04:44.43,0:04:46.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,In any case, I won't allow it.Dialogue: 50,0:04:46.77,0:04:50.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you want to leave that bad, you'll have to go through me!Dialogue: 50,0:04:51.77,0:04:52.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine...Dialogue: 50,0:04:56.73,0:04:59.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A crybaby like you, a man?!Dialogue: 50,0:05:00.66,0:05:02.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh!Dialogue: 50,0:05:03.20,0:05:04.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine...Dialogue: 50,0:05:04.66,0:05:06.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But they...Dialogue: 50,0:05:06.37,0:05:07.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:05:07.33,0:05:09.96,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go!Dialogue: 50,0:05:11.33,0:05:12.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...understand.Dialogue: 50,0:05:12.42,0:05:13.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:05:15.42,0:05:17.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let you have your way!Dialogue: 50,0:05:26.14,0:05:29.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get back here, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:05:30.73,0:05:32.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:05:34.90,0:05:36.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's all that commotion?Dialogue: 50,0:05:36.52,0:05:38.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever it is,Dialogue: 50,0:05:38.65,0:05:42.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,we'd better get these  cannons outside the castleDialogue: 50,0:05:42.03,0:05:45.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,or Dr. Kureha will skewer us!Dialogue: 50,0:05:45.16,0:05:46.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly!Dialogue: 50,0:05:46.58,0:05:48.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wait!Dialogue: 50,0:05:48.24,0:05:50.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I won't let you get away!Dialogue: 50,0:05:50.71,0:05:53.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:05:53.29,0:05:55.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Get back here!Dialogue: 50,0:05:56.54,0:05:59.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's all that racket? It's coming from the castle.Dialogue: 50,0:05:59.26,0:06:01.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on. Have some courtesy...Dialogue: 50,0:06:01.42,0:06:05.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Can't they keep it down while  others are saying goodbye?Dialogue: 50,0:06:07.43,0:06:11.43,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Doctorine, but I want to see the world!Dialogue: 50,0:06:17.57,0:06:20.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What does someone like you hope to accomplish at sea?Dialogue: 50,0:06:20.94,0:06:24.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you going to live in a fantasy like that quack did?Dialogue: 50,0:06:25.99,0:06:27.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You're wrong!Dialogue: 50,0:06:27.03,0:06:28.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It wasn't a fantasy!Dialogue: 50,0:06:28.66,0:06:32.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor's research was completed!Dialogue: 50,0:06:32.83,0:06:34.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, he's coming–Dialogue: 50,0:06:35.67,0:06:36.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:37.04,0:06:38.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:06:38.13,0:06:39.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's being chased!Dialogue: 50,0:06:40.50,0:06:41.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey!Dialogue: 50,0:06:41.51,0:06:43.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The ropeway is rea–Dialogue: 50,0:06:44.72,0:06:46.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Everyone, hop on the sleigh!Dialogue: 50,0:06:46.14,0:06:48.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll take you down the mountain!Dialogue: 50,0:06:51.93,0:06:53.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:07:00.78,0:07:02.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, look over there!Dialogue: 50,0:07:02.15,0:07:03.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What the heck is that?Dialogue: 50,0:07:06.03,0:07:07.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's the witch's sleigh!Dialogue: 50,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What was that?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:01.00,0:08:03.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was Dr. Kureha's reindeer!Dialogue: 50,0:08:03.09,0:08:05.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And those pirates were on the sleigh!Dialogue: 50,0:08:05.30,0:08:07.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened up there?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:07.17,0:08:08.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What happened to Wapol?Dialogue: 50,0:08:08.59,0:08:10.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is Dalton okay?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:14.68,0:08:18.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That was fun! Let's do it again!Dialogue: 50,0:08:18.31,0:08:20.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're setting sail now, you moron!Dialogue: 50,0:08:20.15,0:08:22.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I thought I was a goner...Dialogue: 50,0:08:22.02,0:08:24.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where am I?!Dialogue: 50,0:08:24.19,0:08:27.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, Sanji! You're awake?Dialogue: 50,0:08:32.12,0:08:34.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is it really okay to leave it at that?Dialogue: 50,0:08:38.21,0:08:43.09,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The pet I was fostering is finally being adopted. That's all.Dialogue: 50,0:08:45.42,0:08:48.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not a fan... of sappy goodbyes!Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.06,0:08:56.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Come on!Dialogue: 50,0:08:55.43,0:08:56.31,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow!Dialogue: 50,0:08:56.31,0:08:59.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's prepare a send-off to remember!Dialogue: 50,0:08:59.85,0:09:01.15,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ouch...Dialogue: 50,0:09:03.44,0:09:05.73,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I finally did it... This is it!Dialogue: 50,0:09:05.73,0:09:09.11,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This reaction... I've waited thirty years for this.Dialogue: 50,0:09:09.57,0:09:12.74,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor! It wasn't just a fantasy, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:12.74,0:09:15.99,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Your research was completed, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:16.91,0:09:19.54,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Or was that a lie, too?Dialogue: 50,0:09:19.54,0:09:21.29,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I did it, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:09:21.29,0:09:23.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I've completed my research!Dialogue: 50,0:09:23.50,0:09:27.51,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,You must've known I'd be crushed if you died without succeeding!Dialogue: 50,0:09:27.51,0:09:30.26,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,"Nothing's impossible when a man raises a skull and crossbones flag!"Dialogue: 50,0:09:30.26,0:09:32.47,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I wish I could hear you say it again, Doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:09:37.14,0:09:39.43,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you ready, young men?!Dialogue: 50,0:09:39.43,0:09:40.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yes, ma'am! – Yes, ma'am!Dialogue: 50,0:09:40.48,0:09:41.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Fire!Dialogue: 50,0:09:42.65,0:09:45.31,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, Kureha. This dust...Dialogue: 50,0:09:50.03,0:09:52.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha! What in the world–Dialogue: 50,0:09:52.28,0:09:53.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Just shut up and watch.Dialogue: 50,0:09:59.37,0:10:01.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's coming from the castle!Dialogue: 50,0:10:01.16,0:10:03.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is Wapol shooting off fireworks?Dialogue: 50,0:10:03.42,0:10:05.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Idiot! That's cannon fire!Dialogue: 50,0:10:05.13,0:10:06.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:10:06.38,0:10:07.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Take cover!Dialogue: 50,0:10:07.59,0:10:10.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! It's too dark to see anything!Dialogue: 50,0:10:10.63,0:10:13.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha, we've fired all the ammo!Dialogue: 50,0:10:13.38,0:10:14.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Light 'em up!Dialogue: 50,0:10:25.90,0:10:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Amazing...!Dialogue: 50,0:10:27.77,0:10:28.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 50,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's beautiful...!Dialogue: 50,0:10:33.32,0:10:37.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the answer I found after thirty long years!Dialogue: 50,0:10:37.53,0:10:41.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This truly is a fantastic sight!Dialogue: 50,0:10:42.29,0:10:45.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'll never understand what went  on in that old quack's head.Dialogue: 50,0:10:46.13,0:10:48.50,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I will make cherry blossoms bloom!Dialogue: 50,0:10:48.50,0:10:52.46,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Once my invention is complete, this country will be saved!Dialogue: 50,0:10:53.92,0:10:55.55,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Get out of here, quack!Dialogue: 50,0:10:55.55,0:10:58.93,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Dammit! I thought lizard eyeballs would work!Dialogue: 50,0:11:00.89,0:11:04.98,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen up. This red dust is special.Dialogue: 50,0:11:04.98,0:11:09.77,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,It will bond to  the white snow in the air...Dialogue: 50,0:11:10.15,0:11:13.24,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,and make vivid pink snow fall!Dialogue: 50,0:11:19.66,0:11:21.04,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:11:21.99,0:11:23.83,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Doctorine!Dialogue: 50,0:11:58.49,0:12:01.03,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to shoot you!Dialogue: 50,0:12:01.03,0:12:03.33,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Dr. Hiriluk!Dialogue: 50,0:12:03.33,0:12:04.45,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:12:05.16,0:12:06.83,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Tony Tony Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:12:06.83,0:12:10.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,That's a cool name, isn't it? That's what I'll call you.Dialogue: 50,0:12:10.75,0:12:13.92,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper... you'll make a fine doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:12:13.92,0:12:15.42,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm living proof of that.Dialogue: 50,0:12:21.89,0:12:25.14,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Even if I disappear, my dream will come true.Dialogue: 50,0:12:25.14,0:12:27.85,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What a marvelous life it's been!Dialogue: 50,0:12:31.36,0:12:34.28,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Chopper.Dialogue: 50,0:12:43.91,0:12:45.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now...Dialogue: 50,0:12:45.54,0:12:47.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,have a safe trip,Dialogue: 50,0:12:47.25,0:12:48.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my foolish son...!Dialogue: 50,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This day is the best!Dialogue: 50,0:13:01.18,0:13:03.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The moon's out and cherry blossoms are blooming.Dialogue: 50,0:13:03.72,0:13:05.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper! Hey, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:13:05.56,0:13:06.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You rascal!Dialogue: 50,0:13:06.56,0:13:08.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna sit there in a daze?Dialogue: 50,0:13:09.85,0:13:11.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Drink!Dialogue: 50,0:13:10.35,0:13:11.35,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:13:11.35,0:13:13.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Bust out a song!Dialogue: 50,0:13:12.63,0:13:13.65,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:13:13.65,0:13:15.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Here, stick these chopsticks up your nose!Dialogue: 50,0:13:15.94,0:13:16.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:13:16.82,0:13:19.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Man, what a great view of the cherry blossoms!Dialogue: 50,0:13:19.19,0:13:22.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How could we not party at a time like this?!Dialogue: 50,0:13:22.74,0:13:24.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you surprised?Dialogue: 50,0:13:24.41,0:13:28.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You sure picked some crazy friends, you know!Dialogue: 50,0:13:29.00,0:13:30.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Friends...?Dialogue: 50,0:13:30.87,0:13:32.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yup.Dialogue: 50,0:13:32.00,0:13:35.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They can be a lot to handle, but now that you're one of us,Dialogue: 50,0:13:35.13,0:13:36.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you'll have to get used to it.Dialogue: 50,0:13:38.76,0:13:42.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Karoo! What were you  doing frozen in the river?Dialogue: 50,0:13:45.35,0:13:48.60,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He must've slipped or something! He's such a klutz!Dialogue: 50,0:13:48.60,0:13:50.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Quiet, Mr. Bushido!Dialogue: 50,0:13:51.39,0:13:53.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 50,0:13:53.02,0:13:56.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He said that Zoro guy went  swimming and disappeared.Dialogue: 50,0:13:56.02,0:13:59.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He thought Zoro was in trouble, so he jumped in to help and got frozen.Dialogue: 50,0:13:59.74,0:14:01.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So it was your fault!Dialogue: 50,0:14:01.82,0:14:02.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Ow...Dialogue: 50,0:14:02.57,0:14:05.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tony, you can understand what Karoo is saying?Dialogue: 50,0:14:05.87,0:14:10.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. I can communicate with animals because I am one.Dialogue: 50,0:14:10.37,0:14:12.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You can talk with animals?Dialogue: 50,0:14:12.21,0:14:14.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's incredible, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:14:14.21,0:14:17.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,As if your medical expertise  wasn't enough...!Dialogue: 50,0:14:17.88,0:14:19.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dummy!Dialogue: 50,0:14:19.00,0:14:22.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Complimenting me like that won't make me happy, you jerk!Dialogue: 50,0:14:22.42,0:14:23.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– He sure looks happy. – He sure looks happy.Dialogue: 50,0:14:24.26,0:14:26.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nami, what do you mean by medical expertise?Dialogue: 50,0:14:26.72,0:14:28.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper is a doctor!Dialogue: 50,0:14:28.97,0:14:33.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha herself trained him to be a first-class physician!Dialogue: 50,0:14:33.44,0:14:34.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– What?! – What?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:34.94,0:14:37.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper! You're a doctor?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:37.69,0:14:38.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Incredible!Dialogue: 50,0:14:38.94,0:14:39.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No way!Dialogue: 50,0:14:39.73,0:14:41.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on!Dialogue: 50,0:14:41.11,0:14:44.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What did you think he was when you asked him to join us?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:44.07,0:14:46.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A seven-point transforming reindeer.Dialogue: 50,0:14:47.07,0:14:48.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Emergency rations.Dialogue: 50,0:14:48.24,0:14:49.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 50,0:14:50.16,0:14:55.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I was in such a hurry I forgot my medical supplies!Dialogue: 50,0:14:55.29,0:14:57.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Are you sure? Then, what's this?Dialogue: 50,0:14:56.92,0:14:57.50,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:14:58.50,0:14:59.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My bag!Dialogue: 50,0:14:59.63,0:15:01.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was in the sleigh.Dialogue: 50,0:15:02.38,0:15:03.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How come...?Dialogue: 50,0:15:03.59,0:15:05.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How come?Dialogue: 50,0:15:05.01,0:15:07.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Didn't you prepare for  the trip by yourself?Dialogue: 50,0:15:39.54,0:15:45.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess she read you like a book, even until the very end.Dialogue: 50,0:15:49.01,0:15:50.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,She's a wonderful person.Dialogue: 50,0:15:50.35,0:15:52.10,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,I got snot on the chopsticks!Dialogue: 50,0:15:52.10,0:15:53.14,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,You got this!Dialogue: 50,0:15:51.43,0:15:52.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah...Dialogue: 50,0:15:57.31,0:16:00.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, Chopper! Give it a try!Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.19,0:16:01.69,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seriously!Dialogue: 50,0:16:00.86,0:16:02.69,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:01.69,0:16:03.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,While you're reminiscing...Dialogue: 50,0:16:03.65,0:16:05.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Right, Chopper?Dialogue: 50,0:16:04.19,0:16:06.20,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it, guys! Don't come here!Dialogue: 50,0:16:05.53,0:16:06.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Chopper...?Dialogue: 50,0:16:06.78,0:16:08.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Not you, too!Dialogue: 50,0:16:09.57,0:16:12.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Okay... guys!Dialogue: 50,0:16:12.91,0:16:15.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Attention!Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.37,0:16:16.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You bastard!Dialogue: 50,0:16:15.87,0:16:20.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd like to introduce our new crewmate to you,Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.25,0:16:22.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Sanji! Get him!Dialogue: 50,0:16:20.25,0:16:22.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tony Tony Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.75,0:16:24.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 50,0:16:22.13,0:16:25.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He's gonna be our crew's doctor, and to celebrate–Dialogue: 50,0:16:25.26,0:16:26.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Listen, you jerks!Dialogue: 50,0:16:26.47,0:16:28.51,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Quit it!Dialogue: 50,0:16:28.51,0:16:30.51,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,It's fine, it's fine!Dialogue: 50,0:16:31.85,0:16:33.72,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.93,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Guys! Stop it!Dialogue: 50,0:16:35.93,0:16:38.64,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,You wanna piece of me?!Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.39,0:16:40.44,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,Another chopstick!Dialogue: 50,0:16:29.13,0:16:30.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I...Dialogue: 50,0:16:36.48,0:16:38.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've never had this much fun before.Dialogue: 50,0:16:39.02,0:16:39.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:16:41.02,0:16:43.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's have a toast for our new friend!Dialogue: 50,0:16:43.98,0:16:45.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Yeah! – Yeah!Dialogue: 50,0:16:45.86,0:16:50.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Cheers! – Cheers!Dialogue: 50,0:16:53.78,0:16:56.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if they've left the island by now.Dialogue: 50,0:16:56.95,0:17:01.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A reindeer with a first-rate heart and first-rate skills as a doctor...Dialogue: 50,0:17:01.46,0:17:06.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If the cherry blossoms that Hiriluk put his life into really did lead to a miracle...Dialogue: 50,0:17:08.38,0:17:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess it must be that clumsy  reindeer going out to sea.Dialogue: 50,0:17:13.47,0:17:14.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That kid...Dialogue: 50,0:17:15.26,0:17:17.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,acting like he's all grown up...Dialogue: 50,0:17:18.31,0:17:20.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'll be a fine ship's doctor.Dialogue: 50,0:17:21.73,0:17:25.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what are you going to do from here on out?Dialogue: 50,0:17:26.69,0:17:28.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Before this...Dialogue: 50,0:17:28.74,0:17:32.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I was captain of Wapol's Royal Guard.Dialogue: 50,0:17:32.24,0:17:35.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I will have to atone for that sin.Dialogue: 50,0:17:35.87,0:17:42.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've considered leaving and entrusting this new country to its citizens.Dialogue: 50,0:17:42.62,0:17:46.34,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see... Is that what you've decided?Dialogue: 50,0:17:46.84,0:17:47.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No...Dialogue: 50,0:17:47.88,0:17:51.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I've realized that running away isn't the path to redemption.Dialogue: 50,0:17:52.34,0:17:54.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This land is breaking the shackles of monarchy,Dialogue: 50,0:17:54.64,0:17:57.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and a new country made by the citizens' hands is about to be born.Dialogue: 50,0:17:58.60,0:18:03.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Perhaps there's some way I can contribute to its birth by remaining.Dialogue: 50,0:18:04.65,0:18:10.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I feel that is indeed a way that I can begin to make amends.Dialogue: 50,0:18:11.40,0:18:13.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Young man...Dialogue: 50,0:18:13.07,0:18:17.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,you truly do care for this country.Dialogue: 50,0:18:17.99,0:18:20.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Care for this country, you say...Dialogue: 50,0:18:21.79,0:18:27.54,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I once learned that lesson from a mere ten-year-old girl.Dialogue: 50,0:18:28.42,0:18:30.42,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The World Conference?Dialogue: 50,0:18:30.42,0:18:32.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Such a worthless, tiresome affair.Dialogue: 50,0:18:32.51,0:18:34.55,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Indeed, my liege.Dialogue: 50,0:18:36.30,0:18:40.22,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,I wonder if the Kingdom of Drum can continue like this...Dialogue: 50,0:18:40.56,0:18:43.60,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,The rift between its king and citizens keeps growing...Dialogue: 50,0:18:45.81,0:18:48.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the ruler of Arabasta...Dialogue: 50,0:18:48.07,0:18:50.61,Main-207-,,0,0,5,,King Nefertari Cobra!Dialogue: 50,0:18:53.40,0:18:56.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So that's the famously benevolent and wise king of Arabasta.Dialogue: 50,0:18:58.37,0:19:00.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dragon the Revolutionary...Dialogue: 50,0:19:00.24,0:19:02.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His ideology is dangerous.Dialogue: 50,0:19:03.00,0:19:06.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's clear that in five or six years,Dialogue: 50,0:19:06.75,0:19:11.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,this man will become capable of threatening the World Government.Dialogue: 50,0:19:14.13,0:19:15.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dumb hippos...Dialogue: 50,0:19:15.63,0:19:18.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This has nothing to do with my country.Dialogue: 50,0:19:18.26,0:19:22.64,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,My methods of governing give no room for revolutionaries to mislead my people.Dialogue: 50,0:19:22.64,0:19:25.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you all want to capture him, do it on your own!Dialogue: 50,0:19:25.19,0:19:26.52,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:19:26.52,0:19:28.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cease your selfishness!Dialogue: 50,0:19:28.36,0:19:31.07,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you not realize the Reverie's importance?!Dialogue: 50,0:19:31.07,0:19:33.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have some self-awareness!Dialogue: 50,0:19:34.57,0:19:36.41,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Nefertari Cobra!Dialogue: 50,0:19:38.66,0:19:40.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What an unpleasant conference that was.Dialogue: 50,0:19:41.79,0:19:42.66,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's...Dialogue: 50,0:19:44.08,0:19:46.12,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the daughter of that loathsome Cobra!Dialogue: 50,0:19:49.58,0:19:51.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oops! My hand slipped!Dialogue: 50,0:19:51.67,0:19:52.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,King Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:19:53.63,0:19:54.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Princess Vivi!Dialogue: 50,0:19:54.51,0:19:58.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, apologies! Aren't you the princess of Arabasta?Dialogue: 50,0:19:58.14,0:20:01.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Poor child, being that hopeless king's daughter!Dialogue: 50,0:20:01.51,0:20:03.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You knave! What are you doing?!Dialogue: 50,0:20:03.18,0:20:05.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Stop it, Igaram! I'm fine!Dialogue: 50,0:20:07.19,0:20:09.94,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, too, for bumping into you.Dialogue: 50,0:20:11.77,0:20:13.98,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What an extraordinary child...!Dialogue: 50,0:20:13.98,0:20:16.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When sovereigns gather for the Reverie,Dialogue: 50,0:20:16.40,0:20:19.78,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,even a minor argument can trigger a war.Dialogue: 50,0:20:19.78,0:20:22.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Knowing that, she tolerated the slight...Dialogue: 50,0:20:23.75,0:20:25.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a shrewd child!Dialogue: 50,0:20:27.75,0:20:29.37,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What a repulsive brat.Dialogue: 50,0:20:29.37,0:20:30.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Dalton.Dialogue: 50,0:20:31.38,0:20:32.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Apologies.Dialogue: 50,0:20:36.21,0:20:39.13,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It hurts!Dialogue: 50,0:20:39.13,0:20:43.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You were magnificent, Princess Vivi.Dialogue: 50,0:20:43.85,0:20:46.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The princess' love for her country...Dialogue: 50,0:20:47.43,0:20:49.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,her nobility...Dialogue: 50,0:20:49.44,0:20:51.48,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,hasn't changed one bit.Dialogue: 50,0:20:53.48,0:20:55.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How splendid she turned out to be.Dialogue: 50,0:20:58.32,0:20:59.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton...Dialogue: 50,0:21:00.74,0:21:04.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We also still care for this country.Dialogue: 50,0:21:04.08,0:21:07.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Let us help this land rise anew.Dialogue: 50,0:21:14.17,0:21:16.05,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiriluk...Dialogue: 50,0:21:16.05,0:21:18.67,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,This country will surely be reborn...Dialogue: 50,0:21:18.67,0:21:21.80,Thoughts-207-,,0,0,0,,just like your son, Chopper!Dialogue: 50,0:21:21.80,0:21:25.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dalton, bad news!Dialogue: 50,0:21:25.64,0:21:28.31,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just remembered something terrible!Dialogue: 50,0:21:28.31,0:21:29.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What is it?Dialogue: 50,0:21:29.27,0:21:31.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Check this out.Dialogue: 50,0:21:32.48,0:21:35.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's him! The straw hat pirate who beat Wapol!Dialogue: 50,0:21:35.82,0:21:37.44,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's no doubt about it!Dialogue: 50,0:21:37.82,0:21:41.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,His bounty is thirty million belly? Who are these people?Dialogue: 50,0:21:41.28,0:21:42.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh?Dialogue: 50,0:21:42.57,0:21:45.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seems they weren't just ordinary criminals.Dialogue: 50,0:21:45.99,0:21:47.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Where did you get this?Dialogue: 50,0:21:47.29,0:21:50.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Well... I completely forgot to report it to you, but...Dialogue: 50,0:21:51.37,0:21:52.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,about a week ago,Dialogue: 50,0:21:52.87,0:21:57.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,a traveler suddenly appeared in Robelle Town.Dialogue: 50,0:21:59.21,0:22:02.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It was a strange day. It didn't snow at all.Dialogue: 50,0:22:02.72,0:22:05.10,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We don't even know where he made landfall.Dialogue: 50,0:22:05.10,0:22:07.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway, he went on to sayDialogue: 50,0:22:07.47,0:22:12.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,that he was after Blackbeard, the pirate that attacked this country.Dialogue: 50,0:22:12.85,0:22:16.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But once he realized that Blackbeard was long gone, he said,Dialogue: 50,0:22:16.19,0:22:18.53,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Then let me ask you one more question.Dialogue: 50,0:22:18.53,0:22:21.99,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Has a pirate wearing a straw hat come through here?Dialogue: 50,0:22:21.99,0:22:25.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,When we said we didn't know, he showed the wanted poster and said,Dialogue: 50,0:22:25.99,0:22:28.74,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If he shows up here...Dialogue: 50,0:22:30.33,0:22:31.37,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Shows up...?Dialogue: 50,0:22:31.75,0:22:37.00,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,...tell him I'll be waiting in Arabasta, but only for ten days.Dialogue: 50,0:22:37.00,0:22:38.34,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Got it?Dialogue: 50,0:22:40.59,0:22:42.84,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hold on a second!Dialogue: 50,0:22:42.84,0:22:44.34,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,What's your name?Dialogue: 50,0:22:44.34,0:22:47.30,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah. I forgot...Dialogue: 50,0:22:48.81,0:22:50.47,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,My name is Ace.Dialogue: 50,0:22:50.47,0:22:53.48,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,If you tell him that, he'll know exactly who I am.Dialogue: 50,0:22:59.61,0:23:01.36,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Hey, grab that guy!Dialogue: 50,0:23:01.36,0:23:03.32,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,He's trying to dine and dash!Dialogue: 50,0:23:03.32,0:23:05.49,Flashbacks-207-,,0,0,0,,Just tell him, okay?!Dialogue: 50,0:23:08.45,0:23:11.83,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He'll wait in Arabasta for ten days, huh?Dialogue: 50,0:23:14.16,0:23:16.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Dr. Kureha, what's the matter?Dialogue: 50,0:23:16.79,0:23:18.29,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You look out of it.Dialogue: 50,0:23:18.29,0:23:21.92,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Have you heard of Gol D. Roger?Dialogue: 50,0:23:21.92,0:23:22.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,D.?Dialogue: 50,0:23:23.34,0:23:24.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You mean Gold Roger?Dialogue: 50,0:23:25.34,0:23:28.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Is that what he's called these days?Dialogue: 50,0:23:29.89,0:23:31.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It looks like...Dialogue: 50,0:23:32.27,0:23:37.73,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,my reindeer left with one hell of a guy.Dialogue: 50,0:23:38.15,0:23:40.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So...Dialogue: 50,0:23:41.19,0:23:44.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,the will of D... lives on!Dialogue: 50,0:23:51.03,0:23:53.04,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So, what's Arabasta?Dialogue: 50,0:23:53.04,0:23:55.00,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's the country ruled by Vivi's father.Dialogue: 50,0:23:55.00,0:23:59.17,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A villain named Crocodile is trying to take over Arabasta right now.Dialogue: 50,0:23:59.17,0:24:02.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I hear that Crocodile is one of the Seven Warlords of the Sea.Dialogue: 50,0:24:02.50,0:24:04.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Seven Warlords of the Sea?Dialogue: 50,0:24:04.26,0:24:07.51,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,A group of pirates sanctioned by the World Government.Dialogue: 50,0:24:07.51,0:24:09.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates sanctioned by the government?Dialogue: 50,0:24:09.80,0:24:13.47,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah. They're overwhelmingly strong.Dialogue: 50,0:24:17.56,0:24:21.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They crush other pirates one by one,Dialogue: 50,0:24:21.19,0:24:26.03,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,hence the government authorization.Dialogue: 50,0:24:26.53,0:24:29.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile, huh...? I can't wait to meet him.Dialogue: 50,0:24:29.36,0:24:31.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Crocodile is a hero in ArabastaDialogue: 50,0:24:31.93,0:24:34.79,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,because he stops the pirates  who raid the towns.Dialogue: 50,0:24:34.79,0:24:38.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,But that's just his public facade.Dialogue: 50,0:24:38.62,0:24:42.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,He is the mastermind behind the civil warDialogue: 50,0:24:42.91,0:24:44.88,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,engineered to take over Arabasta.Dialogue: 50,0:24:44.88,0:24:47.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No one has noticed it.Dialogue: 50,0:24:48.26,0:24:50.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Neither the citizens... nor my father...Dialogue: 50,0:24:50.59,0:24:51.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright then!Dialogue: 50,0:24:51.76,0:24:55.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just gotta kick this Crocodile guy's butt, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:24:55.39,0:24:56.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Correct.Dialogue: 50,0:24:56.27,0:25:00.81,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we can first stop the civil war  and expel Baroque Works...Dialogue: 50,0:25:00.81,0:25:02.23,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Baroque Works?Dialogue: 50,0:25:03.02,0:25:05.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's right. You don't know about them either, do you?Dialogue: 50,0:25:05.90,0:25:08.65,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I'm a little lost myself.Dialogue: 50,0:25:08.65,0:25:11.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Baroque Works has a complicated system.Dialogue: 50,0:25:11.74,0:25:13.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The system is actually quite simple.Dialogue: 50,0:25:14.08,0:25:16.95,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Starting at the top, there's the boss, Crocodile...Dialogue: 50,0:25:16.95,0:25:19.25,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,also known as Mr. 0.Dialogue: 50,0:25:20.46,0:25:25.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Taking orders directly from the boss are twelve agents and one animal.Dialogue: 50,0:25:25.46,0:25:29.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Each of the top twelve men is paired with a female agent.Dialogue: 50,0:25:31.18,0:25:34.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There's Mr. 1 and Miss Doublefinger.Dialogue: 50,0:25:34.68,0:25:37.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2 doesn't have a partner, though.Dialogue: 50,0:25:38.02,0:25:41.35,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 3 is the candle man we met in Little Garden, right?Dialogue: 50,0:25:41.35,0:25:44.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. He was paired up with Miss Golden Week.Dialogue: 50,0:25:44.56,0:25:46.61,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, that girl.Dialogue: 50,0:25:47.15,0:25:50.36,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 4 is paired up with Miss Merry Christmas.Dialogue: 50,0:25:50.36,0:25:53.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,However, I don't have much  information on those two.Dialogue: 50,0:25:53.62,0:25:54.82,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,And that snot guy!Dialogue: 50,0:25:54.82,0:25:55.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 5, right?Dialogue: 50,0:25:55.74,0:25:56.45,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Snot?Dialogue: 50,0:25:56.45,0:25:58.20,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he used booger bombs.Dialogue: 50,0:25:58.20,0:26:00.58,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 5's entire body is a weapon.Dialogue: 50,0:26:01.12,0:26:04.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Miss Valentine has the powers of the Kilo-Kilo Fruit.Dialogue: 50,0:26:04.33,0:26:07.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,It's that woman who can change her weight freely, right?Dialogue: 50,0:26:07.30,0:26:11.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 1 through Mr. 5 are called "officer agents."Dialogue: 50,0:26:11.84,0:26:14.39,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They all have devil fruit abilities,Dialogue: 50,0:26:14.39,0:26:17.01,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and they only take on the most important missions.Dialogue: 50,0:26:17.51,0:26:22.19,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 6 through Mr. 13 oversee lower-level employees.Dialogue: 50,0:26:22.19,0:26:26.40,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They collect funds at the start of the Grand Line.Dialogue: 50,0:26:26.40,0:26:28.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,You know, there was a strange monkey and chicken.Dialogue: 50,0:26:29.82,0:26:32.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They would be Mr. 13 and Miss Friday.Dialogue: 50,0:26:32.74,0:26:37.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,They're a punishment squad who primarily deal with members who fail missions.Dialogue: 50,0:26:37.99,0:26:42.62,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Additionally, the officer agents' 200 underlings are called "billions,"Dialogue: 50,0:26:42.62,0:26:46.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,and the frontier agents have 1,800 subordinates called "millions."Dialogue: 50,0:26:47.13,0:26:50.21,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,This is the clandestine crime  syndicate: Baroque Works.Dialogue: 50,0:26:50.21,0:26:53.59,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That means... 1,800 plus 200, so... Dialogue: 50,0:26:53.59,0:26:56.22,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,There are 2,000 underlings?!Dialogue: 50,0:26:55.18,0:26:56.22,Secondary-207-,,0,0,0,,There's 2,000!Dialogue: 50,0:26:56.22,0:26:58.30,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Alright, I get it now!Dialogue: 50,0:26:58.30,0:27:01.93,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I just gotta kick this Crocodile guy's butt, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:27:01.93,0:27:04.14,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Definitely in one ear and out the other!Dialogue: 50,0:27:04.41,0:27:09.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If Baroque Works' last big job is to take over this country...Dialogue: 50,0:27:09.11,0:27:14.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...the rest of those officer agents will all...Dialogue: 50,0:27:14.11,0:27:16.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,...gather in Arabasta.Dialogue: 50,0:27:17.49,0:27:18.91,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes.Dialogue: 50,0:27:18.91,0:27:22.16,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I see... Anyway, I just gotta kick this Crocodile guy's butt–Dialogue: 50,0:27:22.16,0:27:24.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Cool it! We heard you the first time.Dialogue: 50,0:27:24.33,0:27:25.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?Dialogue: 50,0:27:25.58,0:27:28.38,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Un, deux, ourrois!Dialogue: 50,0:27:28.38,0:27:30.67,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Un, deux, korrois!Dialogue: 50,0:27:31.80,0:27:34.97,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry, Mr. 2 Bon Kurei!Dialogue: 50,0:27:35.76,0:27:37.76,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Nobody's clowning here!Dialogue: 50,0:27:37.76,0:27:40.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?Dialogue: 50,0:27:42.43,0:27:44.73,Main-207-,,0,0,5,,I'm Bon Kurei, a Baroque Works officer agent!Dialogue: 50,0:27:44.73,0:27:47.19,Main-207-,,0,0,5,,Even swans fear me!Dialogue: 50,0:27:47.19,0:27:49.77,Main-207-,,0,0,5,,Hey, you! Navigator!Dialogue: 50,0:27:50.15,0:27:51.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes sir!Dialogue: 50,0:27:51.02,0:27:55.53,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Tell me again. What was Zero baby's order?Dialogue: 50,0:27:55.53,0:28:00.99,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Kill Mr. 3 on the direct route between Arabasta and Little Garden.Dialogue: 50,0:28:00.99,0:28:04.87,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So you do remember the mission.Dialogue: 50,0:28:06.21,0:28:09.33,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Direct route means going in a straight line, right?Dialogue: 50,0:28:09.33,0:28:14.63,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,That's why we traveled straight from Arabasta to this Little Garden, right?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:14.63,0:28:17.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,So tell me. What's going on?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:17.18,0:28:22.26,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We sailed straight from Arabasta to Little Garden and never ran into Mr. 3!Dialogue: 50,0:28:22.26,0:28:27.77,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Doesn't that mean that you guys missed Mr. 3's ship?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:28.19,0:28:30.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,N-No...! Th-That can't be right...!Dialogue: 50,0:28:30.02,0:28:33.02,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Oh, so you're calling me stupid?Dialogue: 50,0:28:33.02,0:28:34.28,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,No... Mr. 2–Dialogue: 50,0:28:34.28,0:28:35.49,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Shut up!Dialogue: 50,0:28:36.24,0:28:43.24,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Anyway, operation "wipe out puny Mr. 3" has to go off without a hitch!Dialogue: 50,0:28:43.24,0:28:45.70,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We can't afford to fail.Dialogue: 50,0:28:45.70,0:28:49.71,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If we do, Mr. 1 and his partner will eliminate me.Dialogue: 50,0:28:50.71,0:28:52.96,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Do you understand?!Dialogue: 50,0:28:52.96,0:28:58.68,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,If you don't want to feel my wrath, locate Mr. 3 immediately.Dialogue: 50,0:28:58.68,0:29:01.72,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Super full speed! We're heading to Arabasta on the Swanda!Dialogue: 50,0:29:01.72,0:29:02.80,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Now listen!Dialogue: 50,0:29:02.80,0:29:05.56,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't overlook even a dinghy!Dialogue: 50,0:29:05.56,0:29:06.18,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!Dialogue: 50,0:29:06.18,0:29:08.85,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,– Mr. 2 Bon Kurei! – Mr. 2 Bon Kurei!Dialogue: 50,0:29:10.56,0:29:11.90,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 50,0:29:11.90,0:29:15.11,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Pirates are attacking  towns in the kingdom?Dialogue: 50,0:29:15.11,0:29:17.86,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Don't they know this country is under my protection?Dialogue: 50,0:29:17.86,0:29:20.57,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Who knows, Sir Crocodile.Dialogue: 50,0:29:21.07,0:29:24.74,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,I guess a country in turmoil is an appealing target for pirates.Dialogue: 50,0:29:28.04,0:29:29.08,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Heading out?Dialogue: 50,0:29:30.33,0:29:34.46,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Yes. I have a reputation to uphold.Dialogue: 50,0:29:34.46,0:29:36.50,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,How sweet of you.Dialogue: 50,0:29:39.22,0:29:40.84,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,Of course.Dialogue: 50,0:29:40.84,0:29:44.89,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,The Seven Warlords of the Sea are pirates who crush other pirates.Dialogue: 50,0:29:44.89,0:29:47.27,Main-207-,,0,0,0,,We're heroes to the masses.Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:55.22,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiriluk's Cherry BlossomsDialogue: 1,0:01:49.96,0:01:55.22,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,Hiriluk's Cherry BlossomsDialogue: 0,0:18:26.59,0:18:30.42,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,The Holy Land, Mary GeoiseDialogue: 1,0:18:26.59,0:18:30.42,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,The Holy Land, Mary GeoiseDialogue: 2,0:18:26.59,0:18:30.42,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,The Holy Land, Mary GeoiseDialogue: 0,0:18:48.11,0:18:50.61,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Nefertari Cobra Ruler of ArabastaDialogue: 1,0:18:48.11,0:18:50.61,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Nefertari Cobra Ruler of ArabastaDialogue: 2,0:18:48.11,0:18:50.61,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Nefertari Cobra Ruler of ArabastaDialogue: 0,0:27:25.62,0:27:28.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Little Garden, The Island of GiantsDialogue: 1,0:27:25.62,0:27:28.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Little Garden, The Island of GiantsDialogue: 2,0:27:25.62,0:27:28.38,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Little Garden, The Island of GiantsDialogue: 0,0:27:42.06,0:27:47.35,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2 Bon Kurei Officer Agent, Baroque WorksDialogue: 1,0:27:42.06,0:27:47.35,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2 Bon Kurei Officer Agent, Baroque WorksDialogue: 2,0:27:42.06,0:27:47.35,Captions-207-,,0,0,0,,Mr. 2 Bon Kurei Officer Agent, Baroque WorksDialogue: 50,0:28:35.74,0:28:43.24,Notes-207-,,0,0,0,,Bon KureiDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Video EditingDialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.73,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,Galaxy 9000Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.73,0:00:05